i had a fire nine days ago .
my archive : 175 films , my 16-millimeter negative , all my books , my dad 's books , my photographs .
i 'd collected — i was a collector , major , big-time .
it 's gone .
i just looked at it , and i did n't know what to do .
i mean , this was — was i my things ?
i always live in the present — i love the present .
i cherish the future .
and i was taught some strange thing as a kid , like , you 've got to make something good out of something bad .
you 've got to make something good out of something bad .
this was bad ! man , i was — i cough . i was sick .
that 's my camera lens . the first one — the one i shot my bob dylan film with 35 years ago .
