let 's see what happens here .
( beeps ) oh bruno , you can go home , actually .
bg : great . good news . ( applause ) vv : so ... ( applause ) so the thing about this is that if the pointer , unfortunately , had pointed to the red spot , we would have to rush you to a hospital .
luckily , not today . and if it had pointed to the orange or the amber , it basically meant you had to have , sort of , more continuous care from the health care worker .
