he was rattling off — i mean , that 's amazing , i 'm sorry .
pm : he 's an amazing man .
( applause ) bjk : and then you 're going to have president mary robinson , who 's a former president — thank you , irish ! 62 percent ! lgbtq ! yes ! ( applause )
