and among other things , other countries i worked , was in the soviet union , where i worked from '32 to '37 — actually , to '36 .
i was finally there , although i had nothing to do — i was a foreign expert .
i became art director of the china and glass industry , and eventually under stalin 's purges — at the beginning of stalin 's purges , i did n't know that hundreds of thousands of innocent people were arrested .
so i was arrested quite early in stalin 's purges , and spent 16 months in a russian prison .
the accusation was that i had successfully prepared an attentat on stalin 's life .
this was a very dangerous accusation .
