but there 's always this illusion that if you buy this lamp , you will live in a world without cords . ( laughter ) and the same thing is true of , if you buy this laptop or you buy this computer — and even in these wireless eras , you do n't get to live in the world without cords .
you have to have mystery and you have to have grace .
and there she is — grace .
