it 's about eight inches deep .
when i was doing that , i always wondered since i 've worked with creators — and now you know , i 've moved to questioning the perception — whenever i see the bird flying in the sky , it just makes me feel like : is there anything behind , are there any traces up there , which as a human , we do n't see them ?
is there any way to capture the thought into visual art ?
i could n't find it .
