a guy goes into a psychiatrist .
`` the psychiatrist says , `` '' you 're crazy . '' '' the guy says , `` '' i want a second opinion . '' '' the psychiatrist says , `` '' all right , you 're ugly . '' '' ( laughter ) you all know the test for artificial intelligence — the turing test . ''
a human judge has a conversation with a human and a computer .
if the judge ca n't tell the machine apart from the human , the machine has passed the test .
i now propose a test for computer voices — the ebert test .
if a computer voice can successfully tell a joke and do the timing and delivery as well as henny youngman , then that 's the voice i want .
