`` and these are all areas which are fairly reliably known to be part of what 's called a `` '' theory of mind '' '' circuit , or `` '' mentalizing circuit . '' '' that is , it 's a circuit that 's used to imagine what other people might do . ''
so these were some of the first studies to see this tied in to game theory .
