`` sadly , the frequent overuse of the word `` '' awesome '' '' has now replaced words like `` '' great '' '' and `` '' thank you . '' '' so webster 's dictionary defines the word `` '' awesome '' '' as fear mingled with admiration or reverence , a feeling produced by something majestic . ''
