`` he 's five years old . he 's not going to understand this . '' '' and just as i was having that thought , he looked up at me and said , `` '' so that when i grow up , i can show this to my kids ? '' '' and i thought , `` '' wow , this is powerful stuff . '' '' so i want to leave you with one last memorable moment from our family . ''
