`` i can tap into thousands of people 's minds . '' '' and the other nerdy side of me thought , `` '' this is horrible . this is completely bizarre . ''
`` what does this mean for the future of mankind , where we 're all plugged into this borg ? '' '' i was probably being a little extreme . ''
but what does this mean when we have no context for what it is that we 're working on , and we 're just doing these little labors ?
so i created this drawing tool .
i asked people to draw a sheep facing to the left .
