sometimes people tell me that i look like i 'm playing dress-up , or that i remind them of their seven-year-old .
`` i like to smile and say , `` '' thank you . '' '' thursday : confidence is key . ''
if you think you look good in something , you almost certainly do .
and if you do n't think you look good in something , you 're also probably right .
i grew up with a mom who taught me this day-in and day-out .
but it was n't until i turned 30 that i really got what this meant .
and i 'm going to break it down for you for just a second .
if you believe you 're a beautiful person inside and out , there is no look that you ca n't pull off .
so there is no excuse for any of us here in this audience .
we should be able to rock anything we want to rock .
