you 're going to see yellow happy faces and a few sad blue faces . these are children in the schoolyard in geneva during a recess during the winter . most kids are happy . it 's actually recess .
but a few kids are sad and blue because they 've forgotten their coat .
everybody begins to move around , and your task is to keep track of who had a coat at the beginning and who did n't . so i 'm just going to show you an example where there is only one sad kid . it 's easy because you can actually track it with your eyes . you can track , you can track , and then when it stops , and there is a question mark , and i ask you , did this kid have a coat or not ?
was it yellow initially or blue ?
i hear a few yellow . good . so most of you have a brain . ( laughter ) i 'm now going to ask you to do the task , but now with a little more challenging task . there are going to be three of them that are blue . do n't move your eyes .
please do n't move your eyes . keep your eyes fixated and expand , pull your attention . that 's the only way you can actually do it . if you move your eyes , you 're doomed .
yellow or blue ?
