`` `` '' when people i love leave voicemails on my phone i always save them in case they die tomorrow and i have no other way of hearing their voice ever again . '' '' when i posted this secret , dozens of people sent voicemail messages from their phones , sometimes ones they 'd been keeping for years , messages from family or friends who had died . ''
they said that by preserving those voices and sharing them , it helped them keep the spirit of their loved ones alive .
one young girl posted the last message she ever heard from her grandmother .
secrets can take many forms .
they can be shocking or silly or soulful .
they can connect us with our deepest humanity or with people we 'll never meet again .
